{"seq":2,"slug":"functional-programming-connection","title":"与函数式编程的联系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/category-theory/applications/functional-programming-connection","wordCount":1319,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"与函数式编程的联系\">与函数式编程的联系</h1><p>Haskell 的标准库里有一个叫 <code>Functor</code> 的类型类，它的方法叫 <code>fmap</code>，类型签名是 <code>fmap :: (a -&gt; b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b</code>。把这个签名翻译回范畴论，它就是「函子把态射 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\to b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 映成态射 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f\\,a\\to f\\,b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>」——一字不差。函数式编程不是借用了范畴论几个好听的名字，而是把范畴论的定义直接编译成了语言的类型类层级。本篇专讲这条逐字翻译：<code>Functor</code>/<code>Applicative</code>/<code>Monad</code> 对应什么、定律为何不能省、do-notation 如何脱糖，把上一篇 <a href=\"category-theory-in-cs\">范畴论与计算机科学</a> 的总论收窄到具体语言机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>函数式语言里有一类「带上下文的类型构造子」：<code>Maybe a</code>（可能失败）、<code>[a]</code>（多个结果）、<code>IO a</code>（带副作用）、<code>State s a</code>（带可变状态）。它们的共性是：包了一层「计算上下文」的值。范畴论用三层结构刻画对这层上下文的操作能力，恰好对应 Haskell 的三个超类链。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  F[&quot;Functor&lt;br/&gt;fmap :: (a-&gt;b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b&lt;br/&gt;把纯函数提升进上下文&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;Applicative&lt;br/&gt;pure + (&amp;lt;*&amp;gt;)&lt;br/&gt;把多参函数与多个上下文值组合&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; M[&quot;Monad&lt;br/&gt;return + (&amp;gt;&amp;gt;=)&lt;br/&gt;让后一步依赖前一步的结果&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; K[&quot;Kleisli 范畴&lt;br/&gt;态射 a -&gt; m b&lt;br/&gt;单子运算的几何本体&quot;]\">graph TD\n  F[\"Functor&lt;br/&gt;fmap :: (a-&gt;b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b&lt;br/&gt;把纯函数提升进上下文\"] --&gt; A[\"Applicative&lt;br/&gt;pure + (&amp;lt;*&amp;gt;)&lt;br/&gt;把多参函数与多个上下文值组合\"]\n  A --&gt; M[\"Monad&lt;br/&gt;return + (&amp;gt;&amp;gt;=)&lt;br/&gt;让后一步依赖前一步的结果\"]\n  M --&gt; K[\"Kleisli 范畴&lt;br/&gt;态射 a -&gt; m b&lt;br/&gt;单子运算的几何本体\"]</pre><p>自 GHC 7.10 实施 Applicative-Monad 提案（AMP）以来，这条超类链被写死在 <code>base</code> 里：<code>Functor</code> 是 <code>Applicative</code> 的超类，<code>Applicative</code> 是 <code>Monad</code> 的超类。所以每个单子自动是 applicative，每个 applicative 自动是函子（见 <a href=\"https://wiki.haskell.org/Functor-Applicative-Monad_Proposal\">HaskellWiki: Functor-Applicative-Monad Proposal</a>）。下表把范畴论概念与 Haskell 代码逐项对齐。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范畴论概念</th>\n<th>Haskell 类型类方法</th>\n<th>直觉</th>\n<th>主讲出处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>函子对态射的作用</td>\n<td><code>fmap :: (a-&gt;b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b</code></td>\n<td>把纯函数提升进容器</td>\n<td><a href=\"../foundations/functors\">函子</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单子单位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><code>return</code> / <code>pure :: a -&gt; m a</code></td>\n<td>把纯值放进最小上下文</td>\n<td><a href=\"../core-theorems/monads\">单子</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单子乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><code>join :: m (m a) -&gt; m a</code></td>\n<td>压平两层上下文</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kleisli 复合</td>\n<td><code>(&gt;=&gt;) :: (a-&gt;m b)-&gt;(b-&gt;m c)-&gt;(a-&gt;m c)</code></td>\n<td>串联带上下文的步骤</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绑定</td>\n<td><code>(&gt;&gt;=) :: m a -&gt; (a-&gt;m b) -&gt; m b</code></td>\n<td><code>join . fmap</code> 的打包</td>\n<td>本篇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然变换</td>\n<td>多态函数 <code>forall a. f a -&gt; g a</code></td>\n<td>容器之间的统一转换</td>\n<td><a href=\"../foundations/natural-transformations\">自然变换</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得停一下：Haskell 里一个写成 <code>forall a. f a -&gt; g a</code> 的多态函数（如 <code>listToMaybe :: [a] -&gt; Maybe a</code>），其 <code>forall</code> 约束下的「对每个类型一致地转换」正是自然变换的自然性方块，参数多态由 parametricity 自动保证自然性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fmap-pure-bind-就是函子与单子的定义\">fmap、pure、bind 就是函子与单子的定义</h2><p>把 <code>Maybe</code> 当例子。它的 <code>Functor</code> 实例只有一种写法：<code>fmap g (Just x) = Just (g x)</code>、<code>fmap g Nothing = Nothing</code>。这正是函子作用在态射上、且保持「失败」这个结构。它的 <code>Monad</code> 实例 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 把失败短路：<code>Just x &gt;&gt;= k = k x</code>、<code>Nothing &gt;&gt;= _ = Nothing</code>。</p>\n<p>关键在于 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 并非独立概念，它由单子的范畴论数据派生：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo></mo><mi>k</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>∘</mo><mtext>fmap</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>join</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>fmap</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\mathbin{&gt;\\!\\!&gt;\\!\\!=} k \\;=\\; (\\mu \\circ \\text{fmap}\\,k)\\,(m) \\;=\\; \\text{join}\\,(\\text{fmap}\\,k\\,m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">join</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即「先用 <code>fmap k</code> 把每个结果映成一个新上下文，再用 <code>join</code>(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>) 压平两层」。这条等式说明：只要给出函子加上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>(<code>return</code>) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>(<code>join</code>)，绑定 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 就唯一确定了。<a href=\"../core-theorems/monads\">单子</a> 一篇从范畴论侧证明了 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 表述与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\eta,\\mu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表述完全等价，本篇只取其工程后果：程序员可以用任意一组实现单子，编译器和定律不在乎你选哪组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单子定律不是可选的\">单子定律不是可选的</h2><p>每个 <code>Monad</code> 实例都必须满足三条定律，它们正是范畴论单子公理在 Kleisli 复合下的改写：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定律</th>\n<th>Haskell 形式</th>\n<th>范畴论含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>左单位</td>\n<td><code>return a &gt;&gt;= k</code> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\equiv</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4637em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span></span></span></span></span> <code>k a</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是 Kleisli 复合的左单位元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>右单位</td>\n<td><code>m &gt;&gt;= return</code> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\equiv</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4637em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span></span></span></span></span> <code>m</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是右单位元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结合律</td>\n<td><code>(m &gt;&gt;= k) &gt;&gt;= h</code> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\equiv</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4637em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span></span></span></span></span> <code>m &gt;&gt;= (\\x -&gt; k x &gt;&gt;= h)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 的结合性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些定律不是装饰：编译器和库会假定它们成立来做重写优化，违反它们的「伪单子」会让 do-notation 脱糖出错误结果。GHC 的主要版本每年发布两次，自 9.14 起引入预先公告的 LTS 版本（首个为 9.14，见 <a href=\"https://endoflife.date/ghc\">endoflife.date/ghc</a>），但 <code>base</code> 里 <code>Monad</code> 的定律契约从 AMP 至今没变——这正体现了「定律由数学固定，而非由实现自由发挥」。语言层面无法强制这些定律（Haskell 类型系统不验证等式），它们靠库作者手工保证或在 <a href=\"category-theory-in-cs\">Lean 4</a> 这类证明助手里被机器验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"do-notation-就是单子运算的语法糖\">do-notation 就是单子运算的语法糖</h2><p><code>do</code> 块是 Haskell 写单子代码最常见的形式，但它没有新增任何语义——它机械地脱糖成 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- do 写法&#10;safeDivide :: Double -&gt; Double -&gt; Double -&gt; Maybe Double&#10;safeDivide a b c = do&#10;  x &lt;- safeDiv a b&#10;  y &lt;- safeDiv x c&#10;  return y&#10;&#10;-- 编译器脱糖后（完全等价）&#10;safeDivide a b c =&#10;  safeDiv a b &gt;&gt;= \\x -&gt;&#10;  safeDiv x c &gt;&gt;= \\y -&gt;&#10;  return y\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- do 写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safeDivide :: Double -> Double -> Double -> Maybe Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safeDivide a b c = do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x &#x3C;- safeDiv a b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  y &#x3C;- safeDiv x c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 编译器脱糖后（完全等价）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safeDivide a b c =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  safeDiv a b >>= \\x -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  safeDiv x c >>= \\y -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return y</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个 <code>x &lt;- e</code> 变成 <code>e &gt;&gt;= \\x -&gt;</code>，最后一行直接接上。因为 <code>Maybe</code> 的 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 在 <code>Nothing</code> 处短路，整个 <code>do</code> 块自动获得「任一步失败则全盘失败」的语义——程序员从未写过 <code>if Nothing then ...</code>，短路是单子结构白送的。换成 <code>[]</code> 单子，同样的 <code>do</code> 块会自动变成列表推导式（笛卡尔积）；换成 <code>IO</code>，它变成顺序执行的副作用链。一套语法、由单子实例决定语义，这就是「可编程的分号」。</p>\n<p>到 2026 年，这套抽象已远超 Haskell：Scala 的 <code>for</code>-comprehension、Rust 的 <code>?</code> 运算符（<code>Result</code>/<code>Option</code> 上的受限单子绑定）、F# 的计算表达式、Kotlin 协程的挂起，本质都是单子或其变体的语言内建。范畴论一次定义，被几十种语言反复实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>Functor</code>/<code>Applicative</code>/<code>Monad</code> 三层超类链逐字翻译范畴论定义；AMP（GHC 7.10）把它写进 <code>base</code>。</li>\n<li><code>fmap</code> = 函子对态射的作用；<code>return</code>/<code>pure</code> = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>；<code>join</code> = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>；<code>&gt;&gt;=</code> = <code>join . fmap</code>，由单子数据唯一派生。</li>\n<li>三条单子定律 = Kleisli 复合的单位律与结合律；语言不强制，靠库或证明助手保证。</li>\n<li>do-notation 是 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 的纯语法糖，短路/笛卡尔积/顺序副作用等语义全由单子实例决定。</li>\n<li>2026 年这套抽象已普及到 Scala、Rust <code>?</code>、F#、Kotlin 协程等主流语言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>单子的范畴论定义与三角恒等式：<a href=\"../core-theorems/monads\">单子</a></li>\n<li>函子的一般定义（不限于编程容器）：<a href=\"../foundations/functors\">函子</a></li>\n<li>应用层总论与 Curry–Howard–Lambek：<a href=\"category-theory-in-cs\">范畴论与计算机科学</a></li>\n<li>语言侧的纯函数式实践：<a href=\"../../../languages/haskell-pure-functional/\">Haskell 纯函数式编程</a></li>\n<li>函数式范式的工程化：<a href=\"../../../languages/functional-programming/\">函数式编程</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"与函数式编程的联系","id":"与函数式编程的联系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"fmap、pure、bind 就是函子与单子的定义","id":"fmap-pure-bind-就是函子与单子的定义"},{"level":2,"text":"单子定律不是可选的","id":"单子定律不是可选的"},{"level":2,"text":"do-notation 就是单子运算的语法糖","id":"do-notation-就是单子运算的语法糖"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"范畴论与计算机科学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/category-theory/applications/category-theory-in-cs"},"next":{"title":"范畴逻辑与拓扑斯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/category-theory/applications/categorical-logic-topos"}}